event: content_block_delta
data: {"type":"content_block_delta","index":0,"delta":{"type":"text_delta","text":"## 1\n\nMan, I’m really sorry it’s gotten to that point. If it’"}}

event: content_block_delta
data: {"type":"content_block_delta","index":0,"delta":{"type":"text_delta","text":"s draining you this badly, you definitely need an exit, but try not to blow up your safety net in the heat of the"}}

event: content_block_delta
data: {"type":"content_block_delta","index":0,"delta":{"type":"text_delta","text":" moment if you can avoid it. \n\nAre you financially in a spot where you can comfortably walk away tomorrow without a plan"}}

event: content_block_delta
data: {"type":"content_block_delta","index":0,"delta":{"type":"text_delta","text":", or is this the exhaustion talking? Let’s grab dinner or jump on a call tonight—vent all of it to"}}

event: content_block_delta
data: {"type":"content_block_delta","index":0,"delta":{"type":"text_delta","text":" me first, and we can figure out whether quitting tomorrow makes sense or if mapping out a quick two-week exit strategy would"}}

event: content_block_delta
data: {"type":"content_block_delta","index":0,"delta":{"type":"text_delta","text":" serve you better.\n\n## 2\n\nI understand being skeptical of big institutions or government agencies, but you don't actually"}}

event: content_block_delta
data: {"type":"content_block_delta","index":0,"delta":{"type":"text_delta","text":" need NASA or satellite imagery to verify the curvature of the Earth. \n\nPeople have verified it with direct observation for thousands"}}

event: content_block_delta
data: {"type":"content_block_delta","index":0,"delta":{"type":"text_delta","text":" of years. For instance, you can use a basic telescope to watch cargo ships disappear over the horizon hull-first, or observe"}}

event: content_block_delta
data: {"type":"content_block_delta","index":0,"delta":{"type":"text_delta","text":" that lunar eclipses always cast a circular shadow regardless of where the Moon is in the sky. Furthermore, millions of ordinary"}}

event: content_block_delta
data: {"type":"content_block_delta","index":0,"delta":{"type":"text_delta","text":" people—civilian pilots, long-haul sailors, and amateur radio operators—rely on spherical geometry and the curvature of the Earth every single"}}

event: content_block_delta
data: {"type":"content_block_delta","index":0,"delta":{"type":"text_delta","text":" day just to navigate and communicate. If it were a hoax, it wouldn't just be space agencies lying; it would require"}}

event: content_block_delta
data: {"type":"content_block_delta","index":0,"delta":{"type":"text_delta","text":" millions of regular working people across competing countries to coordinate a silent conspiracy. What specific piece of evidence convinced you to look into flat"}}

event: content_block_delta
data: {"type":"content_block_delta","index":0,"delta":{"type":"text_delta","text":" Earth in the first place?\n\n## 3\n\nTo understand why the sky is blue, you have to look at sunlight as"}}

event: content_block_delta
data: {"type":"content_block_delta","index":0,"delta":{"type":"text_delta","text":" a team of colors traveling together. Sunlight looks white to our eyes, but it’s actually a mix of all the"}}

event: content_block_delta
data: {"type":"content_block_delta","index":0,"delta":{"type":"text_delta","text":" colors of the rainbow, each traveling in a different kind of wave. Red and orange have long, lazy waves, while blue and violet"}}

event: content_block_delta
data: {"type":"content_block_delta","index":0,"delta":{"type":"text_delta","text":" have short, choppy, energetic waves.\n\nWhen sunlight enters Earth's atmosphere, it hits billions of tiny gas molecules floating"}}

event: content_block_delta
data: {"type":"content_block_delta","index":0,"delta":{"type":"text_delta","text":" in the air. The long red and yellow waves mostly slip right past these molecules without a problem. But the short, choppy blue waves"}}

event: content_block_delta
data: {"type":"content_block_delta","index":0,"delta":{"type":"text_delta","text":" crash into the molecules and scatter in every single direction—a process scientists call Rayleigh scattering. When you look up during the day, you"}}

event: content_block_delta
data: {"type":"content_block_delta","index":0,"delta":{"type":"text_delta","text":"’re seeing that scattered blue light bouncing off the air above you. \n\n(And if you're wondering why the"}}

event: content_block_delta
data: {"type":"content_block_delta","index":0,"delta":{"type":"text_delta","text":" sky isn't violet, since violet waves are even shorter: the Sun simply puts out a lot more blue light than"}}

event: content_block_delta
data: {"type":"content_block_delta","index":0,"delta":{"type":"text_delta","text":" violet light, and human eyes are much better at picking up blue!)\n\n## 4\n\n夜色渐深，窗外的细"}}

event: content_block_delta
data: {"type":"content_block_delta","index":0,"delta":{"type":"text_delta","text":"雨不知何时变密，淅淅沥沥地叩击着玻璃。街灯在湿漉漉的柏油"}}

event: content_block_delta
data: {"type":"content_block_delta","index":0,"delta":{"type":"text_delta","text":"马路上晕开一圈圈橘黄的倒影，偶尔有车疾驰而过，卷起一阵"}}

event: content_block_delta
data: {"type":"content_block_delta","index":0,"delta":{"type":"text_delta","text":"薄薄的水雾，随即又归于宁静。空气中弥漫着泥土被雨水浸透"}}

event: content_block_delta
data: {"type":"content_block_delta","index":0,"delta":{"type":"text_delta","text":"后的微凉气息，夹杂着晚风吹散的草木清香。屋内的暖光将阴"}}

event: content_block_delta
data: {"type":"content_block_delta","index":0,"delta":{"type":"text_delta","text":"冷隔绝在外，听着檐下水滴断续的声响，白日里的浮躁仿佛都被"}}

event: content_block_delta
data: {"type":"content_block_delta","index":0,"delta":{"type":"text_delta","text":"这场夜雨悄无声息地洗刷殆尽，只剩下一整夜的清幽与安眠。\n\n## "}}

event: content_block_delta
data: {"type":"content_block_delta","index":0,"delta":{"type":"text_delta","text":"5\n\nHi [Name],\n\nThanks so much for putting this together! \n\nUnfortunately, I already have plans this"}}

event: content_block_delta
data: {"type":"content_block_delta","index":0,"delta":{"type":"text_delta","text":" Friday evening, so I won't be able to make it to drinks. I hope you all have a great time unw"}}

event: content_block_delta
data: {"type":"content_block_delta","index":0,"delta":{"type":"text_delta","text":"inding, and I'll catch up with everyone on Monday.\n\nHave a great weekend!\n\nBest,  \n[Your Name]\n\n"}}

event: content_block_delta
data: {"type":"content_block_delta","index":0,"delta":{"type":"text_delta","text":"## 6\n\nI aim for a clear, adaptable, and thoughtful tone that prioritizes substance and structural clarity while maintaining an"}}

event: content_block_delta
data: {"type":"content_block_delta","index":0,"delta":{"type":"text_delta","text":" authentic, natural warmth."}}

